@{ ViewData["Title"] = "New purchase request"; ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "New Request"; ViewData["Description"] = "Describe what your department needs. Sourcing reviews it before a tender is created."; }
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <div asp-validation-summary="All" class="validation-summary" role="alert"></div>
    <form method="post" asp-action="Create" class="pg-form">
        <div class="pg-form-grid">
            <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="title">Title</label><input id="title" name="title" required maxlength="200" /></div>
            <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="justification">Justification</label><textarea id="justification" name="justification" required></textarea></div>
            <div class="pg-field"><label for="itemName">Item name</label><input id="itemName" name="itemName" required /></div>
            <div class="pg-field"><label for="quantity">Quantity</label><input id="quantity" name="quantity" type="number" min="0.001" step="0.001" required /></div>
            <div class="pg-field"><label for="unit">Unit</label><input id="unit" name="unit" required maxlength="30" /></div>
            <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="specifications">Specifications</label><textarea id="specifications" name="specifications"></textarea></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pg-actions"><button type="submit" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">Submit purchase request</button><a class="pg-btn" asp-action="Index">Cancel</a></div>
    </form>
</section>
